(text "REV T: 288V 32GB / FICTIONAL PEX90064 / THUNDERBOLT 3 HOST\nPEX90064 has an invented 1024-ball map. 10 E1.S x4 plus CPU x4; 20 spare lanes. TB3 host: Alpine Ridge DP + TPS65982. CPU PMIC / BIOS / NVM / SI qualification pending.\nCPU pin directions and power inputs are modeled. ERC power-driver errors expose unfinished supply domains.\nSee README.md and VALIDATION.json before manufacturing." (at 20 15 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "da4deaa5-ac6f-4d8e-8513-2f7bd7401e90"))
